    "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <div><label>读回几条</label><div><b>{0}</b> 行邻居\n          {1}\n          {2}\n          {3}</div></div>\n        {4}\n        {5}\n        {6}\n        {7}\n      </div>": "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <div><label>読み戻し件数</label><div><b>{0}</b> 行のネイバー\n          {1}\n          {2}\n          {3}</div></div>\n        {4}\n        {5}\n        {6}\n        {7}\n      </div>",
    "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <div><label>读的表</label><div><code>{0}</code>\n          <span class=\"dim\">（试过 {1}）</span></div></div>\n        <div><label>读了多少</label><div>{2}</div></div>\n        <div><label>筛完剩下</label><div><b>{3}</b> 条\n          {4}\n          {5}</div></div>\n      </div>": "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <div><label>読んだテーブル</label><div><code>{0}</code>\n          <span class=\"dim\">（試行 {1}）</span></div></div>\n        <div><label>読み取り件数</label><div>{2}</div></div>\n        <div><label>フィルタ後の残り</label><div><b>{3}</b> 件\n          {4}\n          {5}</div></div>\n      </div>",
    "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>多少条</label><div><b>{0}</b></div></div>\n        <div><label>其中没解析出 MAC 的</label><div>{1}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {2}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">「没解析出来」的那几条是内核之前问过、对方没应的占位记录 ——\n        表里有这一行不等于设备在场。★ 这一张卡一个包都不发，它只是把本机现在记着什么念出来。</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">原始结果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{3}</pre></details>": "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>件数</label><div><b>{0}</b></div></div>\n        <div><label>うち MAC を解決できなかったもの</label><div>{1}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {2}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">「未解決」のいくつかはカーネルが以前に問い、相手が応答しなかったプレースホルダ記録 ——\n        テーブルにこの行があることは機器の存在を意味しない。★ このカードはパケットを一つも送らず、本機が今何を記録しているかを読み上げるだけ。</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">生結果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{3}</pre></details>",
    "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>应答</label><div><b>{0}</b> 台</div></div>\n        <div><label>没配好地址</label><div><b>{1}</b> 台</div></div>\n        <div><label>在哪些网卡上听的</label><div>{2}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {3}\n      <div style=\"background:{4};border:1px solid {5};border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px\">\n        {6}</div>\n      {7}\n      {8}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">{9}</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">原始结果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{10}</pre></details>": "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>応答</label><div><b>{0}</b> 台</div></div>\n        <div><label>アドレス未設定</label><div><b>{1}</b> 台</div></div>\n        <div><label>受信中のアダプタ</label><div>{2}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {3}\n      <div style=\"background:{4};border:1px solid {5};border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px\">\n        {6}</div>\n      {7}\n      {8}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">{9}</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">生の結果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{10}</pre></details>",
    "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>扫了哪些网段</label><div><b><code>{0}</code></b></div></div>\n        <div><label>问过</label><div>{1} 个地址</div></div>\n        <div><label>在线</label><div><b>{2}</b></div></div>\n        <div><label>没信号</label><div>{3}</div></div>\n        <div><label>本机链路</label><div>{4}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {5}\n      {6}\n      <div style=\"background:{7};border:1px solid {8};border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px\">\n        {9}</div>\n      {10}\n      {11}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">{12}</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">原始结果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{13}</pre></details>": "\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div><label>スキャンしたセグメント</label><div><b><code>{0}</code></b></div></div>\n        <div><label>照会</label><div>アドレス {1} 件</div></div>\n        <div><label>オンライン</label><div><b>{2}</b></div></div>\n        <div><label>応答なし</label><div>{3}</div></div>\n        <div><label>本機のリンク</label><div>{4}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      {5}\n      {6}\n      <div style=\"background:{7};border:1px solid {8};border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px\">\n        {9}</div>\n      {10}\n      {11}\n      <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">{12}</p>\n      <details style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary class=\"dim\">生結果</summary>\n        <pre class=\"dim\">{13}</pre></details>",
